flowchart LR
  Student[Student browser: anonymous answer] --> API[FastAPI: validation, profanity filter, host cookies]
  Host[Host browser: room controls and guesses] --> API
  Audience[Audience votes in Zoom chat] --> Host
  API --> DB[(Firestore: rooms, receipts, answers, game state)]
  API --> Screen[Pre-game local + Gemini screen]
  Screen --> Clean[Delete flagged records and adjust count]
  Clean --> DB
  Clean --> Generator["Basic / Slang: question only<br/>Chameleon: accepted human references"]
  Generator --> Gemini[Gemini API: answers and individual writing notes]
  Gemini --> Guard[Schema, profanity, length, duplicates, copying checks]
  Guard --> Logic[Python: balanced selection, adaptive order, scoring]
  Logic --> DB
  DB --> API
  API --> Host
  API --> Student
  Tests[Pytest, frontend failure test, live example runner] -. verifies .-> API
  Tests -. verifies .-> Logic
